    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >General</h2>The realistic door simulation with custom physics allows you to experiment and approach the game your way! Experience the gameplay's intricate mechanics such as:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Open the Door<br></li><li> Close the Door</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization</h2>Play with customizable physics settings and optimize the door to your liking (at own risk).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Achievements</h2>Experience this satirical statement on sim games and see what it has in store by obtaining all of the achievements",
